# Raw provider responses. These are large, reproducible from the adapters, and
# have no analytical value once parsed. The curated Parquet under
# data/curated/ IS committed on purpose: it is the historical record this
# project accumulates, and versioning it is what makes any past state of the
# dataset recoverable.
data/raw/

# Credentials. Keys live in GitHub Actions secrets, never in the repository,
# and the static site needs none of them at runtime.
.env
.env.local
*.key
